$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 EF2 {
  coords 3205.355 399.547 11725.5
  m_sTitle "Enemy Forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Enemy forces consist of a US motorised maintenance group from the <b>2nd Battalion, 41st Infantry Regiment, 2nd Armored Division</b>. Their convoy has been halted on the bridge after striking our mine, leaving at least their Bradley Fighting Vehicle immobilised."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• They most certainly radioed for a QRF to respond from the local base. Expect them to be rallying now to move on the convoy ASAP."\
  "Move with haste and waste no time striking."\
  "• The damaged Bradley remains capable of operating its turret despite being immobilised."\
  "• 2x .50cal-equipped HMMWVs are present."\
  "• Enemy forces are currently concentrated around the halted convoy and are expected to establish defensive positions and clearance patrols while repairs are conducted."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "USSR"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF2 {
  coords 3205.355 399.547 11725.5
  m_sTitle "Friendly Forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are a platoon from the <b>1st Motor Rifle Battalion, 70th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment</b>, consisting of 25 personnel. Our forces are operating in the area surrounding the halted US convoy and are preparing to engage the enemy."\
  ""\
  "We have the ability to deploy to 4 different insert locations. "\
  "North, East, South, and West, via the doors at our staging area."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Each squad has organic AT."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• A crate with 6x demo charges and 1x clacker."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "USSR"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS2 {
  coords 3205.355 399.547 11725.5
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Conduct a <b>HASTY ATTACK</b> to <b>DISRUPT</b> the US convoy by <b>DESTROYING</b> critical vehicles in the convoy."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "A US convoy has been halted after striking our mine along a previously cleared route. Their Bradley Fighting Vehicle has suffered engine damage and is currently unable to move."\
  ""\
  "The enemy is temporarily fixed in position while repairs are carried out. We are to exploit this opportunity and attack the convoy before the damaged vehicle can be returned to service."\
  ""\
  "We should focus on the <b>Bradley</b>,<b>command</b>,<b>Ammo</b>,<b>Repair</b>, and <b>fuel</b> trucks. "\
  "The other vehicles are <b>NOT</b> targets."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "USSR"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT2 {
  coords 3205.355 399.547 11725.5
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  "<b>DTL:</b> 05/10/1986, 1800hr, Bystranny."\
  "<b>Weather:</b> Overcast."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "A US convoy travelling along a previously cleared route has been brought to a halt after striking a mine. The incident has left a Bradley Fighting Vehicle with significant engine damage, forcing the convoy to remain in place while repairs are carried out."\
  ""\
  "Soviet forces are operating in the surrounding area and have become aware of the convoy's presence thanks to the strike. With the Americans temporarily unable to continue their movement, the situation is rapidly developing into a confrontation around the stranded convoy."\
  ""\
  "Both sides are now moving to secure their objectives, with the damaged vehicle and the surrounding area likely to become the focal point of the engagement."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "USSR"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 CS {
  coords 3205.355 399.547 11725.5
  m_sTitle "Comsig"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE DEFENCE</b> to <b>PROTECT & HOLD</b> the convoy position until repairs to the damaged Bradley Fighting Vehicle are complete."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "The convoy has been immobilised after striking a mine on a previously cleared route. Our Bradley Fighting Vehicle on point has suffered engine damage and requires repairs before we can continue the journey."\
  ""\
  "Stand to an attack is expected. Man your Bradley, repel the Soviet assault, and protect the repair effort until the Bradley is operational and the convoy can move again."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "USSR"
  }
  m_iOrder 5
 }
}